{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-06T09:06:18.713Z","data":{"text":"Done. Task 2 is implemented and verified.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded sync-time recertification of done tasks whose files only the default-branch merge changed.\n\n**Source changes (in scope):**\n- `src/core/vcs/sync-recertify.ts` (new) — `recertifySyncTasks` performs spec steps 2 & 3: refreshes each kept task's done marker via `refreshRecertifiedDoneMarker`, appends the automatic `recertification` event (attribution `sync` per `findDifferingPaths` display path, `exitCode: 0`, `timedOut: false`, no `output`) to `.run/events/<n>.jsonl`, and stages marker + stream. `createSyncRecertifyState`/`restoreSyncRecertified` back up file contents before first write.\n- `src/core/vcs/sync-verify.ts` — `syncVerifyTasks` now pre-merge hashes each done task's scope and keeps the scope/marker when it matches the done record (step 1); `runSyncVerify` runs recertification after the verify loop and before `synced`; options carry `vcs` + backup state.\n- `src/core/vcs/sync-main.ts` — context carries the backup state; `stopAfter` restores it beside `restoreEvents`; `finishSync` passes `vcs`/state. Stays at 243 lines.\n\n**Test:** `tests/vcs-sync-recertify.test.ts` (new) covers all five scenarios, including the archive-through-`runWatcherCycle` path.\n\n**Verification:** the task's exact command passes (24/24) and the proposal's `pnpm verify` passes (with one transient `report-reads-once` fixture race on a first run that passed on rerun and in isolation).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/152-halt-self-recovery/.run/results/2.md`."}}
